{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure2:2eb930cbd7ce7b23","artifact_id":"Figure2","visual_type":"plot","description":"A four-panel line plot compares StepAlignFB, RefSol, and GRPO over training steps 10–70 on Avg@12, Majority-Vote@12, Pass@12, and mean answer length.","components":[{"name":"StepAlignFB","role":"method series","visual_evidence":"Blue line with circular markers shown in all four panels."},{"name":"RefSol","role":"method series","visual_evidence":"Orange line with circular markers shown in all four panels."},{"name":"GRPO","role":"method series","visual_evidence":"Green line with circular markers shown in all four panels."},{"name":"Avg@12","role":"metric panel","visual_evidence":"Upper-left panel labeled Avg@12."},{"name":"Majority-Vote@12","role":"metric panel","visual_evidence":"Upper-right panel labeled Majority-Vote@12."},{"name":"Pass@12","role":"metric panel","visual_evidence":"Lower-left panel labeled Pass@12."},{"name":"Mean answer length","role":"metric panel","visual_evidence":"Lower-right panel labeled Mean Answer Length (in tokens)."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"StepAlignFB","relation":"is compared with","target_component":"RefSol"},{"source_component":"StepAlignFB","relation":"is compared with","target_component":"GRPO"},{"source_component":"RefSol","relation":"is compared with","target_component":"GRPO"},{"source_component":"StepAlignFB","relation":"has highest displayed value at step 50 in","target_component":"Avg@12"},{"source_component":"StepAlignFB","relation":"has highest displayed value at step 50 in","target_component":"Majority-Vote@12"},{"source_component":"StepAlignFB","relation":"has highest displayed value at step 60 in","target_component":"Pass@12"},{"source_component":"StepAlignFB","relation":"has highest displayed value at step 50 in","target_component":"Mean answer length"}],"findings":["StepAlignFB reaches the highest displayed Avg@12 value at training step 50 and remains above RefSol and GRPO at step 70.","StepAlignFB reaches the highest displayed Majority-Vote@12 value at step 50; RefSol is below it at that step, while GRPO is substantially lower.","For Pass@12, StepAlignFB peaks at step 60, while RefSol reaches a lower plateau near 87 at steps 60 and 70.","GRPO is below the two self-distillation methods on the displayed accuracy metrics at most training steps.","Mean answer length is consistently lowest for GRPO; StepAlignFB peaks at step 50 and then declines, while RefSol remains comparatively high through step 70.","The caption identifies RefSol as reference-solution conditioning, StepAlignFB as step-level feedback, and GRPO as the reward-only baseline."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-1~24","path_id":"1~24","quote":"Figure 2 Self-distillation matches or exceeds GRPO across training on OpenMathReasoning."},{"section_id":"sec-1~24","path_id":"1~24","quote":"RefSol conditions the teacher on the reference solution provided in the OpenMathReasoning dataset; StepAlignFB substitutes step-level feedback; GRPO is the reward-only baseline."},{"section_id":"sec-4.1.","path_id":"4.1.","quote":"Figure 2 plots each metric as a function of the training step."},{"section_id":"sec-4.1.","path_id":"4.1.","quote":"We see that using step-aligned feedback as context outperforms feeding the reference solution."}],"confidence":0.96,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"2826ce2b85bd3bac400a62f6558f05883d8535c8f2794937e2278b8b0f2aac98","context_sha256":"d92f33ad2ee750ce1807bfd819789eb1bf9634ed2c1f9e56320fcb1367bbfb1b","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","requested_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","resolved_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","prompt_sha256":"4786e6f3681b05b0e475e188f0fbd61e98def58906b98ae8010b07dfd44df596","output_schema_sha256":"0386bc6702386f87d7595f5a50c63b60d2fa20f22b58ef050ea6677616e6d1d8","schema_id":"chart_extraction","stage1_visual_type":"plot","prompt_task_sha256":"1dd7985b1567eda8d66c3da3478eab188eb6764f7e1445eb1b1014b72ad08dd6","route_policy_sha256":"897498a